tako itself is licensed under [GPL-3.0-or-later](LICENSE). Third-party works incorporated
into the source tree (icons, shell scripts, the JavaScript and fonts of the phone UI, etc.)
are listed in [THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md](THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).

